# Conduct Electricity targets Bot2's Concealing Curtains (6) and a Rabbit token (2). In response Bot2 Lightning Bolts that Rabbit with Mox Ruby, so the token target is gone on resolution; the spell still resolves (CR 608.2b: it is countered only when every target is illegal), does what it can to the legal target, and Concealing Curtains takes 6 and dies. The 2 damage goes to no one.

